   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Cold ocean waves washing down the sand from the perfectly gradient beach, making a lot of ocean foam in the process. Colors of the sand go from the light gray to black.</rdf:li>
